{#-
  Habi cart drawer shell, included from the base layout on every storefront
  page. A native <dialog> styled like the published cart drawer (right panel,
  400px max, full width on narrow screens, brown backdrop). cart.js fills it
  with the server-rendered _cart-content.twig (cart_mode='drawer') when the
  bag icon is used; without JavaScript the dialog stays empty and the header
  bag link navigates to /cart instead. Also carries the toast region for
  transient add confirmations.
-#}
<dialog id="cart-drawer" class="anim-slide-in bg-surface shadow-overlay" aria-label="Your bag" data-cart-drawer></dialog>

<div class="toast-region" data-cart-toasts aria-live="polite"></div>
